Test-time Anatomical Canonicalization (TAC)
===========================================

This repository contains additions to a third-party codebase. It is not a standalone package and it
does not redistribute the code it extends.

Upstream work
-------------
Adaptive Teacher
    https://github.com/facebookresearch/adaptive_teacher
    Licensed under Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).
    The full text of that license is reproduced in the file LICENSE.

The files under adapteacher/ and tools/ in this repository are new files written for this work. They
import from, subclass and extend Adaptive Teacher, and are intended to be copied into a clone of it.
No file of the upstream repository is reproduced here, with the single exception of LICENSE, which is
carried so that the terms travel with the derivative work.

Terms for the additions
-----------------------
Because these additions are designed to run only as part of a work licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0, they
are released on the same terms: non-commercial use, with attribution. If you use them, cite the paper
named in README.md and attribute Adaptive Teacher as the upstream codebase.

