Methods reimplemented for comparison
------------------------------------
The baselines reported in the paper were obtained in two ways, and the paper keeps them apart. WHW and
CD-Buffer were run from the authors' Apache-2.0 licensed releases. The remaining published methods were
reimplemented from their papers inside this codebase, because no code applicable to this detector was
available; those reimplementations carry the deviations documented in the paper and in the scripts
under runners/, and a gap against the authors' own implementations cannot be excluded.
